WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.262
Lab 2 runs the same checks on a real
account's and tenancy's exports.

2
00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:07.700
Nobody has run it yet, so no
step's output has been seen.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.831
Use one AWS GovCloud account and one O
C I tenancy that aren't production, with

4
00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:17.962
read access to IAM and Roles Anywhere in
the account, and to IAM in the tenancy.

5
00:00:17.962 --> 00:00:22.850
Write the settings and an empty exception
list, in a folder outside the repository.

6
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.336
Run the guide's AWS export commands,
the tag and C R L reads included,

7
00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:30.825
then the O C I ones against
the tenancy's home region.

8
00:00:30.825 --> 00:00:35.498
Then run the checks, and read the findings
and the manifest: it records no request,

9
00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:39.675
because the kit called nothing, and
lists the fourteen export commands.

10
00:00:39.675 --> 00:00:43.607
If every O C I user shows no credentials
while the console shows keys,

11
00:00:43.607 --> 00:00:47.188
the command line's field names
differ from those the kit reads.

12
00:00:47.188 --> 00:00:48.551
Record what they are.

13
00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:52.320
Keep the exports with the run's
evidence, never in the repository.
